{"id":"e522095533d0175f","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-first-order-factoring.md","title":"一阶子句的同极性因子化","display":"df-first-order-factoring — 一阶子句的同极性因子化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-first-order-factoring","aliases":["72-df-first-order-factoring"],"display":"df-first-order-factoring — 一阶子句的同极性因子化","depends_on":["[[72-df-atom-family-mgu]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.6.2 print61–62/PDF73–74; explicit factoring relation","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-first-order-factoring"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-first-order-factoring</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-factoring — 一阶子句的同极性因子化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"866d47bca0b3782c\" href=\"?note=866d47bca0b3782c\" title=\"72-df-atom-family-mgu\">72-df-atom-family-mgu</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.6.2 print61–62/PDF73–74; explicit factoring relation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。所选非空文字集K必须全部为正或全部为负；不允许把互补文字当作同极性副本。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Factor}(C,\\theta,D):\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\varnothing\\ne K\\subseteq C\\ \\bigl[&amp;\n(K\\subseteq\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma\\lor K\\subseteq\\{\\overline A:A\\in\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{MGUAts}(\\{\\operatorname{atm}(l):l\\in K\\},\\theta)\\land D=C\\theta\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Factor}(C,\\theta,D):\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\varnothing\\ne K\\subseteq C\\ \\bigl[&amp;\n(K\\subseteq\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma\\lor K\\subseteq\\{\\overline A:A\\in\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{MGUAts}(\\{\\operatorname{atm}(l):l\\in K\\},\\theta)\\land D=C\\theta\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>选择的同极性文字在θ下相同；集合像自动去重，所以无需再任选删除其中的某些副本。D是整条子句的实例，其余文字也必须代入θ。空子句没有因子化实例；单元素选择允许不改变子句的情形。由子句实例引理，每个因子化都保持全称模型满足。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-atom-family-mgu","status":"resolved","id":"866d47bca0b3782c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-atom-family-mgu]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"C,D\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Factor}(C,\\theta,D):\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\varnothing\\ne K\\subseteq C\\ \\bigl[&\n(K\\subseteq\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma\\lor K\\subseteq\\{\\overline A:A\\in\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma\\})\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{MGUAts}(\\{\\operatorname{atm}(l):l\\in K\\},\\theta)\\land D=C\\theta\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1604,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness]] · [[72-thm-propositional-compactness]] · [[72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness]] · [[72-thm-propositional-compactness]] · [[72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-6","